    "formatted_markdown_T002": "<div class='report'>\n  <h1>\ud83d\udcca Countdown Timer Code Analysis Report</h1>\n\n  <div class='executive-summary'>\n    <h2>\ud83c\udfaf Executive Summary</h2>\n    <p>This report provides a comprehensive analysis of the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript code used to create a countdown timer. The timer features a dark theme and a user-friendly design, counting down from a specified time (initially set to 5 minutes). The code is structured to update the timer every second and display the remaining minutes and seconds. Upon expiration, the timer displays \"EXPIRED\". This report breaks down each component, providing insights and potential improvements.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='code-overview'>\n    <h2>\ud83d\udd0d Code Overview</h2>\n    <p>The countdown timer consists of three main files:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>index.html</code>: The HTML structure that defines the layout and elements of the timer.</li>\n      <li><code>style.css</code>: The CSS file that styles the timer with a dark theme and user-friendly design.</li>\n      <li><code>script.js</code>: The JavaScript file that handles the timer logic, updating the display every second.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='html-structure'>\n    <h2>\ud83e\uddf1 HTML Structure (<code>index.html</code>)</h2>\n    <p>The HTML file provides the basic structure for the countdown timer. It includes a container div, a heading, and a div with the id \"countdown\" where the timer is displayed.</p>\n    <pre><code class='language-html'>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Countdown Timer&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\"&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"container\"&gt;\n        &lt;h1&gt;Countdown Timer&lt;/h1&gt;\n        &lt;div id=\"countdown\"&gt;5:00&lt;/div&